      "description": "Fetch a batch of option quotes (bid/ask/last/close + model IV/delta) for a list of strikes on one expiry/right, via a brief streaming market-data subscription (delayed option data is not available as one-shot snapshots). Duplicate strikes are ignored; capped at 20 strikes per call to respect IB pacing. Defaults to delayed-frozen data (no OPRA subscription needed); set use_delayed=false for live data. Read-only.",
